			"notes": "## Copper Companions v1.0.0 - Forge\n\nInitial release of Copper Companions for Minecraft Forge.\n\n### Features\n\n- Copper golems pick up items intelligently\n- Prioritizes valuable items\n- Puts music discs in jukeboxes automatically\n- Configurable \n\n### Requirements\n\n- Minecraft 1.21.9+\n- Minecraft Forge 59.0.1+\n\n### Installation\n\n1. Download coppercompanions-1.0.0-forge.jar\n2. Place in your mods/ folder\n3. Restart Minecraft\n\n### Configuration\n\nConfigure via config/coppercompanions-common.toml\n\n`[copper_companions]\nsearchRadius = 16\nsearchHeight = 3\npickupAgeThreshold = 20\npickupRange = 2.0\nmaxStuckTicks = 40\nmaxRetries = 2`"
